<ac:layout-cell>
<h2>When to use this</h2>
<p><em>[The exact symptom or event. Link the alert. Say when not to use it and which runbook to use instead.]</em></p>
<h2>Prerequisites</h2>
<ac:task-list>
<ac:task><ac:task-id>1</ac:task-id><ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status><ac:task-body><em>[Access confirmed, for example: can SSH to the host]</em></ac:task-body></ac:task>
<ac:task><ac:task-id>2</ac:task-id><ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status><ac:task-body><em>[Change ticket opened or maintenance window confirmed]</em></ac:task-body></ac:task>
<ac:task><ac:task-id>3</ac:task-id><ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status><ac:task-body><em>[Stakeholders notified in the support channel]</em></ac:task-body></ac:task>
</ac:task-list>
<h2>Steps</h2>
<h3>1. <em>[Confirm the problem]</em></h3>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[systemctl status example.service]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<p><strong>Expected:</strong> <em>[What a healthy or unhealthy result looks like.]</em></p>
<h3>2. <em>[Take the corrective action]</em></h3>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[sudo systemctl restart example.service]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<p><strong>Expected:</strong> <em>[Result.]</em></p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="warning"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Before you continue</ac:parameter>
<ac:rich-text-body>
<p><em>[Anything irreversible or customer-visible in the next step.]</em></p>
</ac:rich-text-body>
</ac:structured-macro>
<h3>3. <em>[Next step]</em></h3>
<p><em>[Step.]</em></p>
<h2>Verification</h2>
<ac:task-list>
<ac:task><ac:task-id>4</ac:task-id><ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status><ac:task-body><em>[Alert has cleared]</em></ac:task-body></ac:task>
<ac:task><ac:task-id>5</ac:task-id><ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status><ac:task-body><em>[Dashboard shows normal values for 10 minutes]</em></ac:task-body></ac:task>
<ac:task><ac:task-id>6</ac:task-id><ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status><ac:task-body><em>[A test request succeeds end to end]</em></ac:task-body></ac:task>
</ac:task-list>
<h2>Rollback</h2>
<p><em>[How to undo each step if verification fails. If a step cannot be undone, say so here and in the warning above.]</em></p>
<h2>Escalation</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>If</th><th>Contact</th><th>How</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[Verification fails after rollback]</em></td><td><em>[Secondary on-call]</em></td><td><em>[Page via rotation]</em></td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[Vendor component is involved]</em></td><td><em>[Vendor support]</em></td><td><em>[Portal link, contract number]</em></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>Close out</h2>
<ul><li><em>[Update the ticket with what was done]</em></li><li><em>[Post in the support channel]</em></li><li><em>[If this took more than N minutes or happened twice this month, open a problem record]</em></li></ul>
<h2>History</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Date</th><th>Run by</th><th>Outcome</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
<tr><td><time datetime="2026-10-28"/></td><td><em>[Name]</em></td><td><em>[Resolved / Escalated]</em></td><td><em>[What was different this time]</em></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</ac:layout-cell>
